  <Docs>
    <summary>Specifies the NFC technology or polling loop event represented by a <see cref="T:Android.Nfc.CardEmulators.PollingFrame" />.</summary>
    <remarks>
      <para>This .NET enumeration represents the Android <c>PollingFrame.POLLING_LOOP_TYPE_*</c> constants returned by <see cref="P:Android.Nfc.CardEmulators.PollingFrame.Type" />. It includes NFC-A, NFC-B, NFC-F, polling loop on and off events, and unrecognized frames.</para>
      <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/nfc/cardemulation/PollingFrame#getType()" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for polling frame types.</a></format></para>
    </remarks>
